---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="acquisition" class="border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-925">
  <!-- Domain Acquisition CTA -->
  <div class="container-narrow section-pad">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-brand-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-850 via-slate-900 to-slate-925 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-glow">
      <!-- Decorative elements -->
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-20 -top-20 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-brand-500/10 blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 h-48 w-48 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 blur-3xl"></div>

      <div class="relative grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-400">
            Premium Domain Available
          </p>
          <h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
            Secure <span class="gradient-text">exoskeletoninjuries.com</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-6 max-w-lg text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            This authoritative domain is positioned at the intersection of emerging wearable robotics, medical device innovation, and industrial safety. Ideal for law firms, research institutions, medical device companies, or content platforms focused on the rapidly expanding exoskeleton sector.
          </p>
          <ul class="mb-8 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              Exact-match industry keyword domain
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              Strong branding potential for legal & medical verticals
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              Clean history • Instant transfer available
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-5 lg:items-end">
          <a
            href="mailto:sales@desertrich.com?subject=Serious%20Inquiry%3A%20exoskeletoninjuries.com&body=Hello%2C%0A%0AI%20am%20interested%20in%20acquiring%20the%20domain%20exoskeletoninjuries.com.%0A%0APlease%20provide%20pricing%20and%20next%20steps.%0A%0AThank%20you."
            class="btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto text-base px-8 py-4 shadow-xl shadow-brand-600/30"
          >
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
            Contact sales@desertrich.com
          </a>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 text-center lg:text-right max-w-xs">
            All serious inquiries receive a response within one business day. Serious offers only.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Bottom bar -->
  <div class="border-t border-slate-800/80">
    <div class="container-narrow flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 py-8 sm:flex-row">
      <div class="text-center sm:text-left">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
          © {year} Desert Rich. All rights reserved.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600 max-w-xl">
          This website is for demonstration and informational purposes only. It does not constitute an offer of services, a commitment to deploy, or a guarantee of outcomes. All statistics, projections, and references to specific technologies are based on publicly available information as of the date shown and are subject to change.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-slate-600">
        <span>Domain: exoskeletoninjuries.com</span>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline">•</span>
        <a href="mailto:sales@desertrich.com" class="hover:text-brand-400 transition">sales@desertrich.com</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
